  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disease Prevention and Control Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to (i) increase the detection of selected NCDs at the PHC level and among pregnant mothers; (ii) improve the efficiency and quality of selected hospitals; and (iii) prevent, detect and respond to the threat posed by COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
